<urn:atm:triage:finding/AY13-QA-007>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AY13-QA-007" ;
  triage:title "rust-qa-agent QA-001: no dedicated unit test for the new per-team Herdr aggregation loop in doctor_projection.rs" ;
  triage:description "quality-mgr qa-pr1300-r1 (PR #1300, AY.13 doctor team scope). The new all-teams aggregation path in StorageDoctorProjection::project/append_herdr_report (looping over report.team_rosters, OR-accumulating report.herdr.configured, and extending report.herdr.endpoints across multiple team rosters) has no dedicated unit test in crates/atm-runtime. atm-core::doctor::mod tests exercise the report-shape (team_rosters populated) but not this daemon-side async aggregation loop, which is the actual code path exercised in production for `atm doctor --all-teams`. Workspace-wide grep for all_teams|team_rosters found no test file references outside the changed production files themselves." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-ay" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
